<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξηρ-ᾰσία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>desiccation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				231.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				384a11
			</span></i> ; <i>keeping dry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.2.2
			</span></i> ; <i>drying</i> of hay, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				441
			</span></i><span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dryness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ περιέχοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.3.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ καυλοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.142
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				6.37
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξηρασίαν λαμβάνειν</span>
			become <i>dry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>drought,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				1.8.13
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
